  "tts": [
    {
      "text": "我以为重生，是老天给我的第二次机会。",
      "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts",
      "context": "男主陆野内心独白，低沉、压住恐惧，有电影旁白感。",
      "output": "audio/inner-01.mp3",
      "speech_rate": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "可那道黑影一开口，我就知道自己错了。",
      "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts",
      "context": "男主陆野内心独白，语气更冷，像突然意识到真相。",
      "output": "audio/inner-02.mp3",
      "speech_rate": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "编号零七，上一轮遗漏者。",
      "speaker": "ICL_uranus_zh_female_xingganmeihuo_tob",
      "context": "机械广播式女声，冷淡、危险、像系统宣判。",
      "output": "audio/broadcast-01.mp3",
      "speech_rate": -2
    },
    {
      "text": "上一轮？遗漏者？",
      "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts",
      "context": "男主陆野内心独白，短促疑问，带一点震动。",
      "output": "audio/inner-03.mp3",
      "speech_rate": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "原来我死过的未来，不是结束。",
      "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts",
      "context": "男主陆野内心独白，压低声音，冷静分析。",
      "output": "audio/inner-04.mp3",
      "speech_rate": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "是被人故意删掉的一页。",
      "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts",
      "context": "男主陆野内心独白，带怒意但克制。",
      "output": "audio/inner-05.mp3",
      "speech_rate": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "陆野，你认识它？",
      "speaker": "ICL_uranus_zh_female_xingganmeihuo_tob",
      "context": "宁晚警惕追问，声音压低，带怀疑。",
      "output": "audio/ning-01.mp3",
      "speech_rate": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "不认识。",
      "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts",
      "context": "陆野低声回答，短、硬、克制。",
      "output": "audio/lu-01.mp3",
      "speech_rate": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "但它认识我。",
      "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts",
      "context": "男主陆野内心独白，冷下来，像确认危机。",
      "output": "audio/inner-06.mp3",
      "speech_rate": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "规则拍卖，即将开启。",
      "speaker": "ICL_uranus_zh_female_xingganmeihuo_tob",
      "context": "机械广播式女声，冷淡、庄严、压迫。",
      "output": "audio/broadcast-02.mp3",
      "speech_rate": -2
    },
    {
      "text": "这一刻我才明白，新世界不是灾难。",
      "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts",
      "context": "男主陆野内心独白，低沉、逐渐醒悟。",
      "output": "audio/inner-07.mp3",
      "speech_rate": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "是有人摆好的赌桌。",
      "speaker": "zh_male_taocheng_uranus_bigtts",
      "context": "男主陆野内心独白，最后一句压低，带狠劲。",
      "output": "audio/inner-08.mp3",
      "speech_rate": 2
    }
  ],
